      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOLDEN BALE (3) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a strong early sectional and went on to clock 29.79 in a head win at Sandown over 515m. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Well placed and can measure up. LAKEVIEW LIAM (4) goes very well at the course and distance with two wins and a placing from four starts. Hit the frame latest (26.02) when second at Warragul in a Grade 4/5. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. AMRON SAMMY (2) racing over this course and distance brings the best out in him.",
